# =============================================================================
# UI-Preview-Tool - .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This .gitignore uses an "include-only" strategy: everything is ignored by
# default, and only the files that are relevant for this repository are
# explicitly re-included. This keeps the published folder clean and free of
# temporary, runtime and unrelated files.
# =============================================================================

# Ignore everything by default
*

# --- Re-include the files relevant to this repository ---
!UI-Preview-Tool.ps1
!README.md
!Documentation.de.md
!Documentation.en.md
!LICENSE
!.gitignore
!Example-Test.xaml
!Complex-Layout-Test.xaml
!Simple-Form-Demo.xaml
!DataGrid-Demo.xaml
!UI-Preview-Tool-release.yml

# --- Explicitly excluded (for clarity) ---
# Runtime / generated files
ui-preview-recent.json
*.json

# Unrelated / legacy files
*.afphoto
*.png
*.code-workspace
Dokumentation-v*.md
UI-Preview-Tool-Dokumentation.md
